{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a7f3c1d2-8e45-4b6a-9c30-1f2e5d7a8b90",
    "name": "API REST para E-commerce",
    "description": "Colección completa de la API REST para E-commerce (ASP.NET Core 8 + EF Core + JWT + SQL Server).\n\nCÓMO USARLA\n1. Selecciona el entorno \"E-commerce - Local\" (o deja las variables de la colección).\n2. Ejecuta \"Login (admin)\" o \"Login (cliente)\": el token se guarda solo en la variable accessToken.\n3. El resto de peticiones ya lo envían en la cabecera Authorization.\n\nVARIABLES\n- baseUrl: http://localhost:5080 (o https://localhost:7080)\n- accessToken / refreshToken: los rellena el login automáticamente\n- orderId / productId: los rellenan el checkout y la creación de producto\n\nUSUARIOS DE PRUEBA\n- admin@ecommerce.com / Admin123$ (rol Admin)\n- cliente@ecommerce.com / Cliente123$ (rol Customer)\n\nNOTA HTTPS: si usas https://localhost:7080, desactiva la verificación de certificado en Settings > General > SSL certificate verification.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Autenticacion",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar cliente nuevo",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Juan\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Perez\",\n  \"email\": \"juan.perez@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Cliente123$\",\n  \"confirmPassword\": \"Cliente123$\",\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"+52 55 1234 5678\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Crea un usuario con rol Customer y devuelve sus tokens. Si el correo ya existe responde 409."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login correcto (200)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', data.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);",
                  "    console.log('Token de ADMIN guardado. Expira en ' + data.expiresInSeconds + ' segundos.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@ecommerce.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin123$\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Inicia sesion como administrador. El script de Tests guarda accessToken y refreshToken automaticamente."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (cliente)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login correcto (200)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', data.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);",
                  "    console.log('Token de CLIENTE guardado. Expira en ' + data.expiresInSeconds + ' segundos.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"cliente@ecommerce.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Cliente123$\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Inicia sesion como cliente. Usalo antes de las carpetas 3 y 4."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Mi perfil",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Devuelve el perfil y los roles del usuario autenticado. Util para comprobar con que token estas trabajando."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Renovar token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', data.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);",
                  "    console.log('Token renovado.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Genera un access token nuevo. El refresh token rota: el anterior queda revocado."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Cambiar contrasena",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentPassword\": \"Cliente123$\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NuevaClave123$\",\n  \"confirmPassword\": \"NuevaClave123$\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/change-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "change-password"]
            },
            "description": "Cambia la contrasena y revoca todas las sesiones abiertas del usuario."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Cerrar sesion (revocar token)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/revoke",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "revoke"]
            },
            "description": "Revoca el refresh token indicado. Responde 204 sin cuerpo."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
